sEVnEOcNFibZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sara is a teen girl who is looking forward to her 18th birthday to move away from her controlling father Don. But before she could even blow out the candles, Don imprisons her in the basement of their home.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12536,\"title\":\"Home Alone 4\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qRktvMOO2QaCL7gvNyvZDoxPOZj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/171wf8HVXZAIScPf9zJyrXpxgRB.jpg\",\"rating\":4.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kevin McCallister's parents have split up. Now living with his mom, he decides to spend Christmas with his dad at the mansion of his father's rich girlfriend, Natalie. Meanwhile robber Marv Merchants, one of the villains from the first two movies, partners up with a new criminal named Vera to hit Natalie's mansion.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":115290,\"title\":\"Blue Lagoon: The Awakening\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ptsBY9Aqo4Mn0V1krI5s8WfFxzW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7VSh4KRB38gs4t4Dlub8GwXNUub.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two high school students become stranded on a tropical island and must rely on each other for survival. They learn more about themselves and each other while falling in love.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Adventure\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":25405,\"title\":\"Taking Chance\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2gPpwshMJHiaIcbL2K234zPGvK1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kSKz1rGzYdCp3cXwaJgmDzZfs2C.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lt. Col. Michael Strobl, a volunteer military escort accompanies the body of Lance Cpl. Chance Phelps to his hometown in Wyoming.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":79218,\"title\":\"Ice Age: A Mammoth Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ue5417HaDcvgMDusryenwwwZARq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fHGrJK08XuVlfiCaUkWYOn3L7QA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Sid accidentally destroys Manny's heirloom Christmas rock and ends up on Santa's naughty list, he leads a hilarious quest to the North Pole to make things right and ends up making things much worse. Now it's up to Manny and his prehistoric posse to band together and save Christmas for the entire world!\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":877703,\"title\":\"Teen Wolf: The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wAkpPm3wcHRqZl8XjUI3Y2chYq2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/96SADhPnkXnVN3KaRKsDeBovLcm.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The wolves are howling once again, as a terrifying ancient evil emerges in Beacon Hills. Scott McCall, no longer a teenager yet still an Alpha, must gather new allies and reunite trusted friends to fight back against this powerful and deadly enemy.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Fantasy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1243341,\"title\":\"Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 4: Dawn of the Vampires\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rGsqBxI4r1YkS9FuraovWi465w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68TGPnvmZ21NBOoV5IUZ4fQDyvZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A new adventure dawns for Zed and Addison when their summer road trip takes an unexpected detour, landing them in the middle of yet another monster rivalry: Daywalkers vs. Vampires. Tensions flare when Zed and Addison find themselves acting as camp counselors between the two opposing supernatural factions. With the help of Eliza and Willa, they must convince sworn enemies Nova and Victor to try to unite their warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13690,\"title\":\"Open Season 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lM4bahouPblYcfngZtnNSkaWxCU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dnZdaGpQ36DlPkyr2bvaxPvc2OA.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After falling head over hooves in love with Giselle, Elliot's road to the altar takes a slight detour when Mr. Weenie is kidnapped by a group of pampered pets determined to return him to his owners.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1493400,\"title\":\"Camp Rock 3\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rS7byWK9cfPfdLeFNlRIaJxH9mN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vJb3fniB8E0JnSMr1tDyIsb6gPi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When pop group Connect 3 returns to Camp Rock to search for an opening act for their reunion tour, rising tensions and fierce competition among campers test old friendships and spark unexpected romances.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10947,\"title\":\"High School Musical\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1DGmWZjUJPeKGFRHGCA6VPFUBML.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2p1nyBVSEBiCTrrZeVSV9nIsqHr.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A popular high school athlete and an academically gifted girl get roles in the school musical and develop a friendship that threatens East High's social order.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"MddiVbnUACA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Gi_qkd9tz-o\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"2PDBPiTeJFg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trai